60065433eefeb7eabc3f99bfd44f590fb8e3499f760776a61e75e9bc3da12b8c  CLAUDE-universal.md
# Declared content hash for the reference copy of the universal rules.
#
# Editing CLAUDE-universal.md REQUIRES updating this file in the same commit. That is
# the whole mechanism: an accidental edit riding along in an unrelated branch fails the
# guard, while a deliberate one is a two-file change nobody makes by accident.
#
# It replaced a merge-base comparison whose remedy was 'run migrate-universal-block.py
# --apply'. Ian retired that obligation on 2026-08-04: the other eight repos are in
# different states and he syncs them himself. The old guard could only be satisfied by
# propagating, so it had become a test that demanded a forbidden action.
#
# Propagation is the maintainer's call. This file says nothing about whether the fleet
# is in sync — only that this repo's copy is what its author intended.
